OL,3,ACalifornia bans child marriage, a
OL,4,Apractice still legal in 32 US states
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalifornia has officially banned child
OL,7,Fmarriage, with Governor Gavin Newsom
OL,8,Fsigning legislation to end the practice
OL,9,Fthat is still legal in 32 US states.
OL,11,FThe new law, which will come into
OL,12,Feffect on 1 January, states people must
OL,13,Fbe 18 to get married in the Golden
OL,14,FState.
OL,16,FNewsom called it a "long overdue
OL,17,Fmeasure to protect young Californians
OL,18,Fand minors". He signed the bill into
OL,19,Flaw with Courtney Stodden, whose
OL,20,Fparents allowed her to marry a
OL,21,F50-year-old Hollywood actor when she
OL,22,Fwas just 16.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
