OL,3,ACalifornia bans child marriage, a
OL,4,Apractice still legal in 32 US states
OL,5,
OL,6,FStodden, who has been advocating to end
OL,7,Fthe practice, called the change a
OL,8,F"victory" and said survivors of child
OL,9,Fmarriage should "never have been
OL,10,Fexpected to carry this burden".
